sgx: build sgx-asm and sgx-disasm with -Dtools=sgx

sgx-asm assembles USSE instructions from text in one batch, for builds
of the GPU's microkernel firmware that have no use for the driver;
sgx-disasm is the matching disassembler. -Dtools=sgx builds both without
the gallium driver, as -Dtools=etnaviv builds etnaviv-disasm:
src/meson.build descends into src/sgx for either, and 'all' includes sgx.

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index c1d56a0..6baab45 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -130,6 +130,7 @@ if with_tools.contains('all')
     'nir',
     'nouveau',
     'panfrost',
+    'sgx',
     'gamma',
     'zink',
   ]
diff --git a/meson.options b/meson.options
index 97f3b9c..6299634 100644
--- a/meson.options
+++ b/meson.options
@@ -559,7 +559,7 @@ option(
   value : [],
   choices : ['amd', 'asahi', 'dlclose-skip', 'drm-shim', 'etnaviv', 'freedreno',  
              'gamma', 'glsl', 'imagination', 'intel', 'intel-ui', 'lima', 'nir',
-             'nouveau', 'panfrost', 'zink', 'all'],
+             'nouveau', 'panfrost', 'sgx', 'zink', 'all'],
   description : 'List of tools to build. (Note: `intel-ui` selects `intel`)',
 )
 
diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index 95cf772..929580d 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -104,7 +104,7 @@ endif
 if with_gallium_panfrost or with_gallium_lima or with_panfrost_vk or with_tools.contains('panfrost')
   subdir('panfrost')
 endif
-if with_gallium_sgx
